K. Li, A. K. Hopkins, D. Bau, F. Viégas, H. Pfister and M. Wattenberg, &ldquo;Emergent World Representations: Exploring a Sequence Model Trained on a Synthetic Task&rdquo;, ICLR 2023. openreview.net · DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2210.13382&#160;&#x21a9;&#xfe0e;
